@base = http://localhost:3000

### indexRouter
GET {{base}}/

### Tất cả sách
GET {{base}}/api/books

### Thêm sách
POST {{base}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Refactoring", "author": "Martin Fowler", "year": 1999 }

### PUT collection -> 403
PUT {{base}}/api/books

### DELETE collection -> 403
DELETE {{base}}/api/books

### Một cuốn
GET {{base}}/api/books/3

### POST lên 1 phần tử -> 403
POST {{base}}/api/books/3

### Sửa
PUT {{base}}/api/books/3
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Dế Mèn" }

### Xoá
DELETE {{base}}/api/books/1

### Đường dẫn cũ -> 404
GET {{base}}/books
